{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/page,_N_T_/,_N_T_/index"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"id\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/1b99372b3eaef0c8-s.p.1gsd1jahc5dg_.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/27xh6zo68oreh.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/3l04zcqx63h3y.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cegfsgm6lvdz.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/02fh7_m5mrih8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-1duz3do6vhzwz.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1pvc-jutjv0md.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><title>JastipKilat - Jastip Makanan Tanpa Markup</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Platform jastip makanan terstruktur, harga asli resto tanpa markup, ongkir transparan, dan live tracking. Khusus Tembalang &amp; Banyumanik.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.2vob68tjqpejf.ico\" sizes=\"256x256\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"outfit_9f19e3a1-module__Yw6YGq__variable font-sans antialiased\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"background-effects\"><div class=\"glow-orb orb-1\"></div><div class=\"glow-orb orb-2\"></div></div><nav class=\"navbar\"><div class=\"logo\">Jastip<span>Kilat</span></div><div class=\"nav-links\"><a href=\"#features\">Fitur</a><a href=\"#how-it-works\">Cara Kerja</a><a href=\"#pricing\">Biaya</a><a href=\"#cta\" class=\"btn btn-primary nav-btn\">Pesan Sekarang</a></div></nav><header class=\"hero\"><div class=\"hero-content\"><div class=\"badge\">🚀 Khusus Area Tembalang &amp; Banyumanik</div><h1>Jastip Makanan <span class=\"highlight\">Tanpa Markup Harga.</span></h1><p>Nikmati Mie Gacoan Setiabudi dengan harga asli kasir resto. Ongkir transparan, live tracking multi-titik, tanpa ribet chat manual.</p><div class=\"hero-buttons\"><a href=\"#cta\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Mulai Pesan</a><a href=\"#how-it-works\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Pelajari Lebih Lanjut</a></div></div><div class=\"hero-image\"><div class=\"glass-card mockup\"><div class=\"mockup-header\"><span class=\"dot red\"></span><span class=\"dot yellow\"></span><span class=\"dot green\"></span></div><div class=\"mockup-body\"><div class=\"tracking-demo\"><div class=\"route\"><div class=\"node active\"><div class=\"icon\">🍜</div><div class=\"info\"><strong>Mie Gacoan Setiabudi</strong><span>Sedang Dimasak</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"></div><div class=\"node \"><div class=\"icon\">📍</div><div class=\"info\"><strong>Kos Tembalang</strong><span>Menunggu Pengantaran</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><section id=\"features\" class=\"features\"><div class=\"section-header fade-in\"><h2>Kenapa Memilih JastipKilat?</h2><p>Berhenti bayar lebih. Kami hadirkan solusi yang menguntungkanmu.</p></div><div class=\"features-grid\"><div class=\"feature-card fade-in delay-1\"><div class=\"feature-icon\">💰</div><h3>Harga Asli Kasir</h3><p>Tidak ada markup bersembunyi seperti aplikasi food delivery lain. Kamu bayar sesuai harga asli resto.</p></div><div class=\"feature-card fade-in delay-2\"><div class=\"feature-icon\">🚚</div><h3>Ongkir Transparan</h3><p>Sistem batching order kami memungkinkan biaya ongkir dibagi secara efisien. Flat Rp 7.000 untuk 3.5km pertama.</p></div><div class=\"feature-card fade-in delay-3\"><div class=\"feature-icon\">🗺️</div><h3>Live Tracking</h3><p>Pantau pesananmu secara real-time. Tidak perlu registrasi ribet, langsung tahu kapan makanan tiba.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"how-it-works\" class=\"how-it-works\"><div class=\"section-header fade-in\"><h2>Cara Kerja</h2><p>Pesan makanan favoritmu hanya dalam 3 langkah mudah.</p></div><div class=\"steps-container\"><div class=\"step fade-in delay-1\"><div class=\"step-number\">1</div><h3>Pilih Driver</h3><p>Lihat daftar driver yang sedang siap atau tunggu driver membuka antrean (Sesi Siap).</p></div><div class=\"step-line fade-in delay-1\"></div><div class=\"step fade-in delay-2\"><div class=\"step-number\">2</div><h3>Bayar QRIS</h3><p>Selesaikan pembayaran aman via QRIS. Uang aman di sistem sebelum diteruskan ke driver.</p></div><div class=\"step-line fade-in delay-2\"></div><div class=\"step fade-in delay-3\"><div class=\"step-number\">3</div><h3>Lacak Pesanan</h3><p>Dapatkan link live tracking. Makananmu akan diantar sesuai urutan rute terdekat.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"pricing\" class=\"pricing\"><div class=\"pricing-card glass-card fade-in\"><h2>Struktur Biaya Transparan</h2><ul class=\"pricing-list\"><li><span>Harga Menu</span><strong>Sesuai Harga Kasir Resto</strong></li><li><span>Ongkos Kirim (0 - 3.5 km)</span><strong>Rp 7.000 (Flat)</strong></li><li><span>Ongkir Tambahan (<!-- -->&gt;<!-- --> 3.5 km)</span><strong>+Rp 2.000 / km</strong></li><li><span>Platform Fee</span><strong>Rp 500 / item</strong></li></ul><div class=\"pricing-total\"><span>Total Bayar</span><strong>Menu + Ongkir + Fee</strong></div></div></section><section id=\"cta\" class=\"cta fade-in\"><div class=\"cta-content glass-card\"><h2>Lapar? Pesan Sekarang.</h2><p>Jangan tunggu lama. Pesan Mie Gacoan sekarang tanpa perlu khawatir harga melonjak.</p><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary pulse\">Buka Web App</a></div></section><footer><div class=\"footer-content\"><div class=\"footer-logo\">Jastip<span>Kilat</span></div><p>© 2026 JastipKilat. All rights reserved.</p></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3l04zcqx63h3y.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[47257,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\"],\\\"ClientPageRoot\\\"]\\n5:I[52683,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1pvc-jutjv0md.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n8:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n9:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\nb:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nd:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\nf:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/27xh6zo68oreh.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/1b99372b3eaef0c8-s.p.1gsd1jahc5dg_.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4624],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/27xh6zo68oreh.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"script-0\\\",{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\",\\\"async\\\":true,\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"html\\\",null,{\\\"lang\\\":\\\"id\\\",\\\"childr